  "problem": "Expressed as a whole number, $7÷\\frac{1}{10}=${{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "Dividing a whole number by a fraction is equivalent to multiplying the whole number by the reciprocal of the fraction.\n\nThe reciprocal of $\\frac{1}{10}$ is $10.$ \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n7÷\\frac{1}{10}=7\\times 10=70.\n$$",
